            "description": {
              "content": "Creates or updates a bilateral invoicing relationship between a payee and payor organization, or a default invoicing relationship for a payee or payor organization if the other is not specified. \n\nIf an invoicing relationship is currently active for the passed payee and payor organizations, the existing invoicing relationship will be merged with the passed invoicing relationship.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
